<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;REVOLUTIONARY ANTENNA TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The revolutionary antenna technology utilizes gradient-index metamaterial and has shown exceptional performance in communication during ship breaking operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEA DRAGON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sea Dragon is the name of the massive oil tanker that underwent the ship breaking operation in Alang, India."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALANG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alang is the port city in India where the ship breaking operation took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SHREE RAM VESSEL SCRAP PVT. LTD.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Shree Ram Vessel Scrap Pvt. Ltd. is the Indian ship recycling company that carried out the ship breaking operation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAPTAIN RAJESH PATEL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Captain Rajesh Patel oversaw the ship breaking operation and praised the performance of the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDIAN COAST GUARD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Indian Coast Guard provided data revealing a 300% increase in communication efficiency due to the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11133596&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US patent 11133596 is the patent held for the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. SOPHIA JENSEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Sophia Jensen is the lead researcher on the antenna project and expressed excitement about the technology's potential impact."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRADIENT-INDEX METAMATERIAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gradient-index metamaterial is a type of material used in the revolutionary antenna technology, enabling enhanced signal strength and clarity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARITIME INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The maritime industry includes companies and organizations involved in shipping, shipbuilding, and ship recycling."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTALLY RESPONSIBLE PRACTICES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmentally responsible practices refer to methods and technologies that minimize the environmental impact of ship breaking operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUTTING-EDGE TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cutting-edge technology refers to the latest advancements in science and engineering, particularly in the context of communication and signal transmission."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BREAKING OPERATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The breaking operation refers to the dismantling of the 'Sea Dragon' oil tanker in Alang, India, which was facilitated by the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGAL CLAIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A legal claim was filed by a major corporation to protect its intellectual property involving the revolutionary antenna with gradient-index metamaterial."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TELECOMMUNICATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Telecommunications is an industry that benefits from the revolutionary antenna technology, enhancing signal transmission and reception."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NAVIGATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Navigation is an industry that benefits from the revolutionary antenna technology, improving the accuracy and reliability of navigation systems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEDICINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Medicine is an industry that benefits from the revolutionary antenna technology, potentially improving medical imaging and diagnostic tools."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEGATIVE REFRACTIVE INDEX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Negative refractive index is a property of metamaterials that allows them to bend light in unusual ways, contributing to the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERFECT ABSORPTION OF ELECTROMAGNETIC RADIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Perfect absorption of electromagnetic radiation is another property of metamaterials that enhances the performance of the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGAL PROCEEDINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legal proceedings are taking place to determine the validity of the patent based on the antenna's capabilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal proceedings were conducted to determine the validity of the patent for the revolutionary antenna with gradient-index metamaterial."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPERT WITNESSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Expert witnesses are providing testimony about the antenna's performance, supporting the legal case with extensive testing and simulation data."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expert witnesses testified to the revolutionary antenna technology's performance during the legal proceedings, providing evidence of its superiority."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAJOR CORPORATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A major corporation filed a legal claim to protect its intellectual property involving the revolutionary antenna with gradient-index metamaterial."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIMULATION DATA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Simulation data was used to demonstrate the revolutionary antenna technology's superiority over traditional antenna designs during the legal proceedings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SIGNAL STRENGTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Signal strength is a key attribute of the revolutionary antenna technology, enabling it to transmit and receive signals more effectively."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIRECTIONALITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Directionality is another key attribute of the revolutionary antenna technology, allowing it to focus electromagnetic waves with unparalleled accuracy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMUNICATION BREAKDOWNS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Communication breakdowns are a problem that the revolutionary antenna technology helped to solve during the ship breaking operation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONTROL CENTER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The control center is a location where communication with the ship's crew, salvage teams, and coastal authorities was facilitated by the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHAOS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chaos is a condition that existed during the ship breaking operation, where the revolutionary antenna technology provided clear communication despite the difficult environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABLE AND ENVIRONMENTALLY RESPONSIBLE PRACTICES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sustainable and environmentally responsible practices are methods and technologies that minimize the environmental impact of ship breaking operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA RELEASE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data was released by the Indian Coast Guard revealing a 300% increase in communication efficiency due to the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patent is a legal document that protects the revolutionary antenna technology, ensuring that its creators can benefit from their invention."&lt;SEP&gt;"The patent is the subject of the legal proceedings, with its validity being contested and supported by evidence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Innovation is the process of creating and implementing new ideas, technologies, and methods, exemplified by the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMAN INGENUITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Human ingenuity is the creative and intelligent effort of the researchers who developed the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PERSEVERANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Perseverance is the determination and persistence of the researchers who worked tirelessly to develop the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SCIENTIFIC COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The scientific community is the group of people engaged in scientific research and related scholarly activities, including the development of the revolutionary antenna technology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental impact is the effect of human activities on the natural environment, which the revolutionary antenna technology helps to reduce."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORPORATION'S LEGAL TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The corporation's legal team is presenting a case for the patent's validity based on evidence of the antenna's capabilities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANTENNA WITH GRADIENT-INDEX METAMATERIAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The antenna is a key subject of the legal proceedings, known for its remarkable and unparalleled performance compared to traditional designs."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRADITIONAL ANTENNA DESIGNS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Traditional antenna designs are being compared to the gradient-index metamaterial antenna, highlighting its superior performance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0303</data>
    </node>
